     8	  TOPT : minimal N with b4^N in <T_t..T_{2t-1}>  (TOP-TAIL-UNIT <=> exists)
     9	  CHARTS: exact b4=0 and (optionally) b4=1 full-chart unit tests
    10	"""
    11	import argparse, re
