+
+Every Singular invocation in this lane ran in the foreground under
+`timeout 1800`; no job used more than one core, and at most three lane jobs ran
+concurrently.  `.resource` files record wall time, maximum RSS, and exit
+status.  Only outputs with completion marker, empty stderr, zero resource
+exit, and no error scan hit are accepted.  The full initial-ideal lists are
+kept as TSV artifacts because the completed list already has 5,830 generators
+at `t=7`.

