+| `t` | field | minimal generators | least pure-power exponents in `(b4,q2,...,b3)` order |
+|---:|---|---:|---|
+| 3 | exact | 20 | `(8,6,4)` |
+| 4 | exact | 81 | `(10,7,6,5)` |
+| 5 | mod 1009 | 340 | `(12,8,7,7,6)` |
+| 6 | mod 1009 | 1391 | `(14,10,8,8,7,6)` |
+| 7 | mod 1009 | 5830 | `(16,11,9,8,8,8,7)` |
