+```text
+N_(2,-)=1-s^6-s^7-s^8+s^9+s^10,
+Hilb=N_(2,-)/D_2
+    =1+s+s^2+2s^3+2s^4+2s^5+2s^6+s^7
+     +(s^9+s^10)/(1-s^3).
+```
+
+The series does not terminate, `dim=1`, and
+
+```text
+in_wp(I_(2,+))=(b4^6,b4^4*b3,b4^2*b3^2),
+```
+
+so there is no pure `b3` power.  This is the required negative control.
+
+At `y=2/5`,
