+where `[sum a_n s^n]_+` stops immediately before the first coefficient
+`a_n<=0`.  An independent Gaussian-binomial calculation uses
+
+```text
+R_t(s) = [4t choose 2t-1]_s (1-s^t)
+         product_(j=t+2)^(2t-1)(1-s^j)
+```
